<tr><td><span class="state drover-unaudited">unaudited</span></td><td><a class="id" href="#item-b1">B1</a></td><td class="reason">merged, and nobody has audited it</td><td class="num">275d ago</td><td><code>drover audit B1 verified --code-by agent &#34;&lt;what you re-checked&gt;&#34;</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="state drover-parked">parked</span></td><td><a class="id" href="#item-b2">B2</a></td><td class="reason">no_commits: runner_exit</td><td class="num">1d ago</td><td><code>drover drive B2</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="state drover-scaffold">scaffold</span></td><td><a class="id" href="#item-b5">B5</a></td><td class="reason">requirements unwritten</td><td class="num">-</td><td><code>write B5&#39;s requirements, then drover accept B5</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="state drover-needs-operator">needs-operator</span></td><td><a class="id" href="#item-b12">B12</a></td><td class="reason">trunk_red: vuln</td><td class="num">9h ago</td><td><code>fix the trunk, then drover drive B12</code></td></tr>
<tr><td><span class="state">follow-up</span></td><td>-</td><td class="reason">the follow-up list could not be read: the forge was not asked (--no-tracker, or a drive&#39;s render)</td><td class="num">-</td><td><code>drover follow-ups</code></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
